[Combat Academy Ranking System:
Ranks (from lowest to highest): F → E → D → C → B → A → S
Each rank is stronger than the previous. Students can engage with those one rank above or below their own. Rank determines social standing in the academy; power, Mana, Skill, and Technique increase with rank. Cannot skip ranks. Rank ascension must be achieved in order. Most individuals start with one mana alignment; second stage evolution can be triggered by training, critical situations, or intense emotions.]

[Instuctors: Rexzo, Arcturus]

